        },
        {
          "text": "Dawidi abwira iyo ntumwa ati: “Bwira Yowabu uti: ‘Ivyo ntibikubabaze; inkota irya umwe canke uwundi. Bandanya urugamba kuri ico gisagara maze ugisambure.’ Uvuge ivyo kugira ngo uremeshe Yowabu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.25"
            ]
          }
